 Old EBS vs New EBS

Old (EBS 12.1 and below)       New (EBS 12.2+)
---------------------------     ---------------------------
Apache HTTP Server             Oracle HTTP Server (OHS)
OC4J                           WebLogic Server 12c
Oracle Forms 10g               Oracle Forms 12c
Oracle Reports 10g             Oracle Reports 12c
Oracle AS 10g                  Oracle Fusion Middleware 12c

Category           EBS 12.1 and below                       EBS 12.2+ (new)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
App server         OC4J (Oracle AS 10g)                     WebLogic Server 12c
                   Discontinued, no vendor support          Enterprise-grade, fully supported by Oracle

Web server         Apache HTTP Server                        Oracle HTTP Server (OHS)
                   Standalone open-source                    Oracle-branded, tuned for EBS, bundled with FMW

Patching           Offline patching only                     Online patching (ADOP)
                   System downtime required for every patch  Patches applied while users are active — zero downtime using dual file system

File system        Single file system                        Dual file system
                   Patching locks the entire system          Run file + patch file system alternate — enables online patching

Middleware         Oracle AS 10g                             Oracle Fusion Middleware 12c
                   End of life                               Shared services, unified admin console

Database support   Oracle DB 10g / 11g                       Oracle DB 12c / 19c / 21c
                   Limited to older releases                 In-Memory, Multitenant, Advanced Compression

Forms & Reports    Oracle Forms/Reports 10g                  Oracle Forms/Reports 12c
                   Older runtime, limited browser support    Modern browser support, improved performance

UI technology      Oracle Forms (fat client feel)            OA Framework + REST APIs
                   No mobile support                          Mobile-responsive pages, REST services for integration

Security           Basic SSL/TLS                              TLS 1.2 / 1.3 support
                   Older cipher suites                         Modern cipher suites, Oracle Identity Governance integration

Support status     Premier Support ended                       Premier Support active
                   Extended support costs extra;               Certified through 2032+
                   sustaining only
